"P1199603259" "Electrical Blast endows you with ranged electrical attack powers. Electrical powers can drain foes' Endurance and can often temporarily halt their Endurance recovery. This can be quite effective against higher level foes and Bosses. Some Electrical Blast powers can even sometimes transfer this Endurance back to you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Charged Bolts 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P406048882" "Charged Bolts"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1298334033" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Energy), Foe -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P3154574924" "You can quickly hurl small bolts of electricity at foes, dealing some damage and draining some Endurance. Some of this Endurance may transfer back to you. Charged Bolts deals light damage but recharges quickly. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1416730328" "You shock {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1226085207" "{PlayerSource} shocks you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2154700027" "Your {PowerName} drains some endurance from {PlayerDest}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P456748222" "{PlayerSource} shocks you with their {PowerName} and drains some of your Endurance!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1051884142" "You recover some of the Endurance you drained."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Lightning Bolt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3269743464" "Lightning Bolt"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1519530153" "Ranged, High DMG(Energy), Foe -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P2907957244" "You can send a large blast of electrical energy at a foe, dealing heavy damage and draining some Endurance. Some of this Endurance may transfer back to you. Lightning Bolt deals more damage than Charged Bolts, but recharges more slowly. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P482297281" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ball Lightning 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2138267515" "Ball Lightning"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P256474272" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DoT(Energy), Foe -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P1307115454" "Hurls a highly charged ball of lightning that explodes on contact. Ball Lightning deals good damage in an area of effect, and drains some Endurance from each target it hits. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1831456333" "DoT(Energy)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2467806480" "The Ball Lightning is continuing to electrocute you."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1428594006" "You hit {PlayerDest} with {Damage} points of energy damage from your {PowerName}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2374480795" "{PlayerSource} hits you for {Damage} points of energy damage with their {PowerName}."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P115594690" "Your {PowerName} deals an additional {Damage} points of energy damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1304278633" "{PowerName} continues to electrocute you for {Damage} points of energy damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Short Circuit 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2973226331" "Short Circuit"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1862125547" "PBAoE, Moderate DoT(Energy), Foe -End, -Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P3033630842" "Releases a burst of electrical energy around you, shocking all nearby foes. This highly accurate discharge deals Moderate damage over time, drains a lot of Endurance from the targets and renders them unable to recover Endurance for quite a while. Additionally, Short Circuit deals extra damage to most robots and mechanical foes. Short Circuit is very effective when used with your other Endurance draining powers. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2867007302" "DoT(Energy), -Recovery"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1469494981" "The Short Circuit is continuing to electrocute you.  Your Endurance recovery is greatly reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P689159219" "Your {PowerName} shocks {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P377575083" "{PlayerSource} electrocutes you for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3810503626" "Your {PowerName} drains {PlayerDest} Endurance!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1788514463" "Your {PowerName} deals an extra {Damage} points of energy damage to {PlayerDest}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Tesla Cage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4277270469" "Tesla Cage"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2228407903" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Energy), Foe Hold, -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P3119539010" "Tesla Cage confines the target in an electrical prison. The target is overwhelmed by the electrical charge and is left helpless and can be attacked. The target is drained of some Endurance and some of that Endurance may be transferred back to you. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3220742713" "Hold"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P630142524" "The Tesla Cage is holding you helpless."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3720756566" "Your {PowerName} holds {PlayerDest}, paralyzing them!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4054835770" "{PlayerSource} holds you in place with their {PowerName} attack!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1501284489" "Your {PowerName} electrocutes {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Voltaic Sentinel 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4186800839" "Voltaic Sentinel"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3227875875" "Summon Sentinel: Ranged, Moderate DMG(Energy), Foe -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P2824999601" "You can manifest a polarized electricity field that hovers above the ground and hurls bolts of electricity at nearby foes. Any enemy that passes near this Sentinel risks serious injury. The Sentinel is not alive and cannot be targeted or attacked by enemies. The Sentinel can fly and will follow you. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P964605222" "You focus your electrical powers to form a {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Transfusion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2614747173" "Transfusion"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3141505437" "Ranged, Foe -End, -Regen, Team Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P3363453526" "Transfusion drains an enemy of some Endurance and reduces the target's Regeneration rate, and transfers that energy, in the form of Hit Points, to all allies near the affected foe. You can use Transfusion to heal yourself as well as your allies. Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P977901485" "-Regeneration"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2832674077" "Your Regeneration rate has been reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2780757799" "Your {PowerName} siphons the endurance and regeneration rate of {PlayerDest}"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1139971843" "{PlayerSource} siphons off your endurance and regeneration rate!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Siphon Power 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1943804202" "Siphon Power"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1215489231" "Ranged, Foe -DMG, Team +DMG"
// Power Help Text :
"P17415485" "You can Siphon the Power from a targeted foe, reducing their damage potential. The power is transferred back to you, increasing your own damage potential and that of all nearby allies. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P4292955663" "You reduced the damage potential of {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} to increase your own!"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1557233358" "{PlayerSource} reduces your damage potential with {PowerName} to increase their own!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2850056344" "-DMG"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2043380143" "Your damage potential has been reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Siphon Speed 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3614500476" "Siphon Speed"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1897206312" "Ranged, Foe -Speed, Self +Speed, +Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P2146416737" "You can Siphon the speed from a targeted foe, Slowing their movement and attack rate while boosting your own. Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1490875287" "-SPD, -Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3187278069" "Your Running Speed potential has been altered.  If this is a friendly power, your Running Speed is increased.  If you were attacked with this power, though, your Running Speed is reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3760447537" "You {PowerName} from {PlayerDest} to increase your own!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1887331290" "{PlayerSource} slows you with {PowerName} to increase their own!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Speed Boost 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3686758356" "Speed Boost"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P146937202" "Ranged, Ally +SPD, +Recharge, +Recovery, Res Slow"
// Power Help Text :
"P553862191" "You can hasten a single targeted ally. The target's movement speed, attack rate, and Endurance recovery are all greatly increased and the target gains resistance to Slow effects. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1930511113" "You {PowerName} {PlayerDest}, greatly increasing their movement rate, attack rate and endurance recovery!"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2717324833" "{PlayerSource} improves your movement rate, attack rate and endurance recovery with an extra {PowerName}!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P922167688" "+SPD, +Recharge, +Recovery, Res Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1810162801" "You've been granted a Speed Boost.  Your Attack speed, Endurance recovery and Running speed are all increased and you are resistant to Slow effects."

