// Power : Group Invisibility 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1245546238" "Group Invisibility"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4270190323" "PBAoE, Team Stealth, +DEF(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P572103610" "Makes you and all teammates around you Invisible. While Invisible, you and your teammates are almost impossible to detect. Even if discovered, Group Invisibility grants a bonus to your Defense to all attacks, although you will lose some of your defense bonus if you attack. Group Invisibility has no movement penalty. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1701765549" "You hide {PlayerDest} within your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P4071210598" "{PlayerSource} makes you invisible!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3665457053" "Invisible, +DEF(All)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3770865509" "You have been made Invisible and are difficult to detect.  Your Defense is increased as a result."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic Siphon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P646438851" "Sonic Siphon"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3255195607" "Ranged, Foe -Res(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1007995414" "By setting up a constant vibration within the body of your foe, you weaken their Damage Resistance. Affected targets will take more damage from successful attacks.   Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3647738614" "Your {PowerName} has reduced {PlayerDest}'s resistances."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P182951110" "Your resistance to damage has been reduced by the {PowerName} of {PlayerSource}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3466742994" "-Res(All)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P290923559" "Your Resistances have been weakened by the Sonic attack."

