"P2886195292" "Melee, Minor DMG(Lethal), DoT(Toxic), -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P4070830036" "Shred your opponent with several quick Swipes from your Spines. Barb Swipe deals minor damage over time. Spine poison deals additional Toxic damage and Slows affected foes. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Very Fast"
