"P1026516307" "You shred {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3754812110" "{PlayerSource} shreds you with {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P947486191" "You finish up your {PowerName} with a for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
