"P2583689436" "PBAoE Melee, Moderate DMG(Lethal), DoT(Toxic), -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P3549181803" "You can fling dozens of Spines in all directions. These Spines only travel a short distance, but they can deal moderate damage and poison any target close to you. Spine poison deals additional Toxic damage and Slows affected foes. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
