"P3315500229" "When you toggle on this power, you are surrounded in a Conductive Shield that will conduct many sorts of energy away from your body. Conductive Shield grants high resistant to Fire, Cold, and Energy damage, as well as good resistance to Negative Energy damage. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1256776711" "Your {PowerName} has made you highly resistant to fire, cold, energy, and negative energy damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Electric Fence 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1082437617" "Electric Fence"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3536834546" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Energy), Foe Immobilize, -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P1283732797" "Surrounds and Immobilizes a single target in an Electric Fence. Deals some damage over time and slowly drains some Endurance. Useful for keeping villains at bay. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P368684123" "Immobilize"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3462979101" "You are immobilized by the Electric Fence."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3385120024" "Your {PowerName} electrocutes {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P306078268" "{PlayerSource} electrocutes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P362106426" "You Immobilized {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2175482535" "{PlayerSource} immobilized you with a {PowerName}!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Zane 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P172442163" "Zane"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3230180477" "You can surround yourself in powerful defensive Energy Auras that can deflect your foes' attacks. Like other defensive powers, Energy Auras do not reduce the damage you take, but rather reduce your chance of getting hit by deflecting your foes' attacks.  Energy Auras offer good defense to most attack types, but offer superior defense to Energy based attacks.  However, Energy Aura offers no defense to Psionic attacks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Kinetic Shield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2163874469" "Kinetic Shield"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2557169965" "Toggle: Self +DEF(Smashing, Lethal, Energy), Res(DeBuff DEF)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3452730963" "Kinetic Shield creates a harmonic Energy Aura that can deflect physical attacks.  Your Defense to Smashing and Lethal attacks is increased as weapons and powers like bullets, blades and punches tend to deflect off the shield. Kinetic Shield also grants you good resistance to Defense Debuffs. The Energy based nature of Kinetic Shield also offers some minimal Defense to Energy attacks.  Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3163663381" "You Kinetic Shield increased you Defense to Lethal, Smashing, and to some degree, Energy attacks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dampening Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P632564129" "Dampening Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4215017788" "Auto: Self +Res (Smashing, Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3387662500" "Your body resonates a mild Dampening Field that absorbs kinetic energy from physical weapons.  This auto power permanently reduces all incoming Smashing and Lethal damage. This power is always on and costs no Endurance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Power Shield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P265715099" "Power Shield"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1321888080" "Toggle: Self +DEF(Fire, Cold, Energy, Negative), Res(DeBuff DEF)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1579469061" "This Power Shield creates a Electro-Magnetic shield around you that can deflect non-physical attacks.  Your Defense to Fire, Cold, Energy and Negative Energy attacks is increased as these attacks are reflected or refracted off the shield. Power Shield also grants you good resistance to Defense Debuffs. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1478393842" "You Power Shield increased you Defense to Fire, Cold, Energy and Negative Energy attacks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Energy Protection 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1420895182" "Energy Protection"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2615392788" "Auto: Self +Res (Energy, Negative, Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P4103874964" "Your ability to channel energy makes you naturally resistant to Energy, Negative Energy and Toxic damage. This power is always on and costs no Endurance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Quick Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3807885890" "Quick Strike"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3814896443" "Melee, Light DMG(Smash/Energy), Foe -DMG, 33%% KD"
// Power Help Text :
"P1388643021" "A quick attack that sometimes knock foes down. Fast, but low damage. Damage: Low, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2158031629" "You hit {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3775041263" "{PlayerSource} hits you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3309853544" "You hit {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1264124699" "{PlayerSource} hits you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4243055354" "You knocked {PlayerDest} from their feet with your {PowerName} attack!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1703008310" "Your Power Siphon increases your strength!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Body Blow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3513231302" "Body Blow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3369676297" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Smash/Energy), +Stun"
// Power Help Text :
"P3966281746" "A much more powerful, yet slower version of Quick Strike. Body Blow is capable of stunning an opponent occasionally. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2694015104" "Your {PowerName} blasts {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P921516098" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1746676435" "Your {PowerName} blasts {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2539714258" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Repulsing Torrent 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P268745046" "Repulsing Torrent"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4153242871" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Energy/Smash), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P195978086" "Repulsing Torrent unleashes a cone of powerful energy that can smash foes and possibly send them flying. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2839943724" "You slam {PlayerDest} to the floor deal {Damage} points of smashing damage with your {PowerName}."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2764143754" "You slam {PlayerDest} to the floor deal {Damage} points of energy damage with your {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Power Blast 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P183208535" "Power Blast"
// Power Help Text :
"P1556459424" "A much more powerful, yet slower version of Power Bolt. Power Blast sends a focused beam of energy at a foe that can knock them back. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Warrant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P529620251" "Warrant"
// DisplayHelp :
"P366756904" "Energy Blast allows you to hurl bolts of energy at your foes, and can often send them flying with Knockback."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Power Bolt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3452065131" "Power Bolt"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P655547927" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Energy/Smash), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P2797312721" "A quick attack that rapidly hurls small bolts of energy at foes, sometimes knocking them down. Fast, but little damage. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Power Blast 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Explosive Blast 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3004620291" "Explosive Blast"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1775382294" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DMG(Smash/Energy), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P4131221748" "You hurl a blast of charged energy that violently explodes on impact, damaging all foes near the target. Explosive Blast may knock targets backwards. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P966793536" "You hit {PlayerDest} with {Damage} points of smashing damage from your {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Personal Force Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3978803010" "Personal Force Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3850683110" "Toggle: Self +Def, Res(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2723592640" "The Personal Force Field is almost impenetrable to all attacks, even Psionics and Enemy Teleportation, although attacks from more powerful foes may get through more easily. Personal Force Field will also reduce the damage of any attacks that do get through. The Personal Force Field works both ways; while it is active, you can only use powers that affect yourself. Cannot be used with Rest. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3782792257" "Your {PowerName} makes you virtually invulnerable to most attacks, but you can only cast powers on yourself while the Force Field is active."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Force Bolt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3532762553" "Force Bolt"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1949322042" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Smash), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P1133545432" "Discharges a bolt of force that knocks down foes and deals some Smashing Damage. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1956747474" "Your {PowerName} pounds {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P524369720" "{PlayerSource} pounds you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : DUST_MN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P4192472812" "DUST_MN"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P324409477" "Praetorian DUST"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Force Punch 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P8896387" "Force Punch"
// Power Help Text :
"P4205343396" "DUST Rangers are equipped with powered armor that allows them to easily carry their special plasma cannon. This also increases the strength of their melee blows, making a melee attack from a DUST member a serious threat."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1397128752" "Stun"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P385021222" "The force of the DUST soldier's punch has left you stunned."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1083611728" "{PlayerSource} smashes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3765550891" "{PlayerSource} strikes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Plasma Stream 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2681586394" "Plasma Stream"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2395640198" "DoT (Fire, Energy), -Regen"
// Power Help Text :
"P4273995690" "DUST forces are equipped with a variable fire plasma projection weapon. The default firing mode allows the DUST Ranger to use their weapon as a high efficiency flamethrower, launching exceptionally charged plasma streams at a target. This causes damage over time and reduces regeneration rates of affected targets."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2812065818" "Your regeneration rate has been reduced!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3249152586" "{PlayerSource} burns you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1925622485" "{PlayerSource} burns you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of fire damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1685074847" "Your regeneration rate has been reduced by {PowerName}!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : DUST_LT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P496879319" "DUST_LT"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Toxic Burst 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3237785869" "Toxic Burst"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2551738773" "Targeted AoE Toxic, DoT (Toxic), -Regen, -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P2106143102" "The DUST primary weapon can have its ignition system switched off, allowing the soldier to fire the fuel as a projectile. This projectile bursts in a small area around the target, dealing toxic damage to all those in the vicinity. The volatile chemicals evaporate quickly, causing continuous toxic damage, as well as regeneration reduction and possible Endurance drain."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2810172070" "DoT (Toxic), -Regen, -End"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2463278616" "You are being choked by noxious fumes, which also reduces your regeneration rate and may cause Endurance drain."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3850170282" "You are caught in the explosion of a {PowerName} and suffer {Damage} points of toxic damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1699818849" "The noxious fumes from the {PowerName} continue to cause {Damage} points of toxic damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P220831481" "Your endurance is being drained by {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Shockwave Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2020375227" "Shockwave Grenade"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2049308478" "Moderate DMG (Lethal/Smashing), DoT (Lethal), Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P2233543493" "DUST forces are equipped with a variable fire plasma projection weapon. Their secondary fire mode allows them to lob a highly damaging Shockwave Grenade at their target. This causes bleed damage over time and can knock their target from its feet."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3708769538" "DoT (Lethal), Knockback"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3503424744" "You are bleeding due to the grenade's shrapnel!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2222041349" "You are caught in the explosion of a {PowerName} and suffer {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3234459808" "You are caught in the explosion of a {PowerName} and suffer {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1678932088" "You are bleeding for {Damage} points of lethal damage due to the shrapnel from a {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3363014697" "You have been knocked back by a {PowerName}!"

